msgstr "FreeBSD 专用的 DHCP 客户端配置脚本。此脚本在 man:dhclient-script[8] 中有说明，正常运行时通常无需用户修改。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network-servers/_index.adoc:1789
#, fuzzy
msgid "[.filename]#/var/db/dhclient.leases.interface#"
