"Ensure that the `ntpd` user has access to all the files and directories "
"specified in the configuration."
msgstr "确保 `ntpd` 用户可以访问配置中指定的所有文件和目录。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network-servers/_index.adoc:2736
